## Code provenance

The byte-level BPE tokenizer foundation was adapted from
[kimi-k3-in-c](https://github.com/FareedKhan-dev/kimi-k3-in-c), copyright
Fareed Khan and contributors, and is used under the Apache License 2.0. The
retained implementation is tailored to the Qwen tokenizer stored in GGUF.

The NFC normalization tables in `third_party/tok_nfc_data.h` are generated
from the Unicode 9.0.0 Character Database. The Unicode data license is
included in `third_party/UNICODE-LICENSE.txt`.

The Qwen3.8 model graph, GGUF reader, quantized CPU kernels, batching,
recurrent state management, sampling, command-line runtime and MTP
verification in this repository are native project code. No external
inference engine is downloaded or invoked at runtime.

## Model

[Qwen3.8-27B](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3.8) is released by the Qwen
team under Apache License 2.0.

The default GGUF is published by
[Unsloth on ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF).

Model weights are downloaded into the user's cache and are not redistributed
in this repository.

